---
title: Detection as code, run by an agent
---
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Agentic detection-as-code workflow
    accDescr: GitHub Copilot CLI finds a coverage gap through Splunk MCP, builds a detection from a SigmaHQ rule, and opens a pull request. GitHub Actions tests it in Splunk and AI Toolkit triages the noise. Copilot tunes it, the engineer approves the merge, the deploy workflow installs it in Enterprise Security, and Copilot confirms it is live.
    autonumber

    box rgba(120, 120, 140, 0.12) Workstation
        actor Eng as Detection engineer
        participant Copilot@{ "type": "control" } as GitHub Copilot CLI
    end
    box rgba(80, 140, 255, 0.10) GitHub
        participant GH@{ "type": "database" } as Repo + Actions
    end
    box rgba(240, 0, 140, 0.10) Splunk Cloud
        participant MCP@{ "type": "boundary" } as Splunk MCP
        participant ES@{ "type": "database" } as Enterprise Security
        participant AITK@{ "type": "entity" } as AI Toolkit
    end

    rect rgba(120, 120, 140, 0.10)
        Note over Eng,AITK: Find the gap
        Eng->>+Copilot: Are we covered for LSASS dumps via comsvcs.dll?
        Copilot->>MCP: Read deployed detections
        MCP-->>Copilot: ESCU rule is off and misses ordinal variants
    end

    rect rgba(80, 200, 120, 0.08)
        Note over Eng,AITK: Detection as code
        Copilot->>Copilot: SigmaHQ rule to detection and tests<br/>(sigma-cli, contentctl)
        Copilot->>GH: Open a pull request
    end

    rect rgba(80, 140, 255, 0.08)
        Note over Eng,AITK: CI tests and tunes
        GH->>ES: Replay tests, check a week of data
        GH->>AITK: Triage the noisy alerts
        AITK-->>GH: Expected purple-team activity
        GH-->>Copilot: Tests pass, noise over budget
        Copilot->>GH: Push the team's narrow tuning
        GH-->>Copilot: CI green
    end

    rect rgba(240, 0, 140, 0.08)
        Note over Eng,AITK: Approve and deploy
        critical Merging deploys to production
            Copilot-->>Eng: Approve the merge?
            Eng->>Copilot: Approved
        end
        Copilot->>GH: Merge
        GH->>ES: Deploy workflow installs the detection
    end

    rect rgba(80, 200, 120, 0.08)
        Note over Eng,AITK: Verify
        Copilot->>MCP: Is it live?
        MCP-->>Copilot: On, scheduled, catches every variant
        Copilot-->>-Eng: Deployed and live
    end
